Has anyone else tried to get nethack 3 running on two architectures
(Sparc and Sun3 here) using the same game directories. I've modified
the main Makefile and shell script to move the compiled game to

	nethack.`arch`

which csh expands to nethack.sun3 or nethack.sun4. This works fine now
to play on either Sparc or Sun3 ... but I find that games saved on one
architecture can't be restarted on the other. Anyone got any ideas why
this is so .... also will this affect bones files etc as well ???

